QtRocket is a C++ re-implementation of OpenRocket (https://openrocket.info), Copyright (C) 2007-2025 Sampo
Niskanen and others, licensed under the GNU General Public License version 3 or later. The component model,
aerodynamic and mass calculations, simulation engine and the .ork file format follow OpenRocket's design and
algorithms. The bundled motor database (data/motors/initial_motors.db) and example designs (data/examples/) are
taken from OpenRocket unchanged. The designs of older file format versions that the tests read (tests/data/ork/)
are example and test designs of OpenRocket's releases 0.9.4 to 23.09, copied unchanged from its repository;
tests/data/ork/README.md lists the release and the path of each.
